    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="45e7df9e-31bc-5d63-af50-65814ddadf44" activityNameId="420a30f3-50e4-54fd-9228-1d70e04bb50c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Light fuel oil, burned in boiler 10kW, condensing, modulating</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Light fuel oil, burned in boiler 10kW, condensing, modulating
Inventory for the operation of a modern condensing, modulating low-temperature oil boiler for one-family houses, data related to fuel input.;
UUID: ff80aca8-1655-3139-a6e7-a3a40333433e
Direct air emissions from combustion, waste, effluents and auxiliary electricity use, input of fuel oil.  Infrastructure is included.
Location: Assumption for operation in Switzerland.
Technology: Average modulating, condensing boiler used in 2016.
Time period: Estimation for regulated emissions investigated in 2016. Data for subsidiary regulated emissions are partly based on older literature data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data published in literature based on measurements and technical data sheets. 
Extrapolations: Some information from other European countries has been used to determine the emission factors.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ff80aca8-1655-3139-a6e7-a3a40333433e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
